  </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection-title\">推荐运动</div>\n    <div class=\"exercise-grid\">\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">🚲</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">自行车</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">🏊</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">游泳</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">🏃</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">慢跑</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">💃</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">广场舞</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">🧘</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">瑜伽</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n        <div class=\"exercise-icon\">🥋</div>\n        <div class=\"exercise-label\">太极</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"note-text\">\n      更年期妇女在运动锻炼中应尽量避免向某一关节-骨骼系统损伤，合理进行有氧运动，条件合适可以进行肌力肌肉训练。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection-title\">推荐运动量</div>\n    <div class=\"stats-row\">\n      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n        <span class=\"stat-icon foot-icon\">👣</span>\n        <span>6000步</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-box\">\n        锻炼最佳方式为每周至少<span class=\"highlight\">3次</span><br>\n        最佳时长为 <span class=\"highlight\">30min/次</span><br>\n        每周坚持进行<span class=\"highlight\">2~3次</span>肌肉训练 💪\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stats-row\">\n      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n        <span class=\"stat-icon heart-icon\">❤️</span>\n        <span>150次/min</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <!-- 维持体重 -->\n    <div class=\"section-title\">维持体重</div>\n    <div class=\"text-block\">\n      随着年龄的增长，人体的基础代谢率缓慢下降，此外，雌激素分泌的减少将进一步降低女性的基础代谢率。40~49岁时可降低5%，50~59岁时可降低10%。从绝经前进入更年期后体内脂肪在体内蓄积，维持正常体重有利于更年期女性健康。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bmi-bar\">\n      <div class=\"under\"></div>\n      <div class=\"normal\"></div>\n      <div class=\"over\"></div>\n      <div class=\"obese\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bmi-labels\">\n      <span>偏瘦</span>\n      <span>18.5</span>\n      <span>21.9</span>\n      <span>偏胖</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bmi-center-label\">更年期女性理想BMI</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bmi-formula\">\n      计算公式：<code>BMI=体重/身高的平方[即kg/(m)²]</code>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex-row\">\n      <div class=\"scale-icon\">⚖️</div>\n      <div class=\"weight-loss-box\">\n        肥胖妇女体重若减轻<br>\n        <span class=\"red\">5%~10%</span>，就能有效改善与肥胖相关的多种异常情况。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <!-- 其他 -->\n    <div class=\"section-title\">其他</div>\n    <div class=\"others-grid\">\n      <div class=\"other-item\">\n        <div class=\"other-icon\">😴</div>\n        <div class=\"other-label\">足量睡眠</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"other-item\">\n        <div class=\"other-icon\">🍼</div>\n        <div class=\"other-label\">注意避孕</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"other-item\">\n        <div class=\"other-icon\">🚭</div>\n        <div class=\"other-label\">戒烟</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"other-item\">\n        <div class=\"other-icon\">🍷</div>\n        <div class=\"other-label\">戒酒</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right Column -->\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n    <div class=\"top-right-title\">更年期健康知识可视化</div>\n\n    <!-- Food Chart -->\n    <div class=\"food-chart\">\n      <div class=\"food-chart-placeholder\">\n        <!-- Food Labels -->\n        <div class=\"food-label fl-grain\">\n          <div class=\"name\">谷类</div>\n          <div class=\"amount\">每天250~400g</div>\n          <div class=\"amount\">粗杂粮50~150g</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"food-label fl-veg\">\n          <div class=\"name\">蔬菜</div>\n          <div class=\"amount\">每天300~500g</div>\n          <div class=\"dots\">🍎🍎🍎🍎🍎</div>\n        </div>\n    